{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the depths of the amphibian afterlife, the eponymous UNDERPOND, in this procedurally generated, hand-drawn, frog-hopping roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/extras/216410fd7fea51e47433eb36a0842720.avif?t=1762876574\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop for your Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop, swing, bounce, and more to survive. Use your unique froggy movement to dodge the many horrors the underpond has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the secrets of the Underpond from the Everwatching Swamp to the Temple of Souls and many more. Each area brings news enemies, traps and surprises you must look out for. Each run is randomly generated so no two are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/extras/16fa35b014bb00db341f768c6887ba46.avif?t=1762876574\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pacts with the Devil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Pacts, powerful abilities to help you in your journey. From dashing through the air, to exploding through terrain, you\u2019ll do things no frog has done before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way through the Underpond, choose which path you take. Will you face up to big risks, or play it safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960140?t=1762876574","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960140?t=1762876574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/bcb091a23af8fb727bacaa6390f62c3deb54ac0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762876574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/bcb091a23af8fb727bacaa6390f62c3deb54ac0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762876574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the depths of the amphibian afterlife, the eponymous UNDERPOND, in this procedurally generated, hand-drawn, frog-hopping roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/extras/216410fd7fea51e47433eb36a0842720.avif?t=1762876574\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop for your Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop, swing, bounce, and more to survive. Use your unique froggy movement to dodge the many horrors the underpond has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Unique World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the secrets of the Underpond from the Everwatching Swamp to the Temple of Souls and many more. Each area brings news enemies, traps and surprises you must look out for. Each run is randomly generated so no two are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/extras/16fa35b014bb00db341f768c6887ba46.avif?t=1762876574\" width=600 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pacts with the Devil</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Pacts, powerful abilities to help you in your journey. From dashing through the air, to exploding through terrain, you\u2019ll do things no frog has done before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your way through the Underpond, choose which path you take. Will you face up to big risks, or play it safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Frog Soup"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960140/7f5657c16031fc077095985f3ac39824573623ad/header.jpg?t=1762876574","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960140/359908179/a95f88deb2383a03d4a2f33879fff17fcb813509/1762852791/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762866761","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960140/359908179/a95f88deb2383a03d4a2f33879fff17fcb813509/1762852791/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762866761","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3960140/359908179/a95f88deb2383a03d4a2f33879fff17fcb813509/1762852791/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762866761","id":257228851,"name":"Underpond Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228851/947c721fc172ca4c95c74b47aa0c2934a572a17a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762866761"}],"name":"Underpond","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<